tnjPdVmmuLQQ7kNvwHlayHV&_nc_oc=AdqbNBjVJcfnQVCxqYi5AdyLmNqTkr7xtArqL0C557AJrfWsct2hSbYxU7d0nrj3CwM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRI5WmTnmAVHl5aNy8I8nNym4_sw1Orx1Qos1B2wmQY_Q&oe=6AF1D537"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ivYyTYbD_0EQ7kNvwH8vGq7&_nc_oc=AdrnGZiA_i1EqDvtPDb2IE9mSvfXmVFEu90-J6FPxLfs73-8kgE-RPceBje4mlYpa3I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQh69CMhawtXBgvyt0I_zcM1vBDp6tbEu4M_4Kz93pFDA&oe=6AF1D6CA"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2T2dfW18mrgQ7kNvwHzUt3H&_nc_oc=AdqVmMbVITnpgO4NrjgYNjhQMHGLAEsGtQt3w-tT2iH3QcNqYqDNLaOcqGgJuyw2nBU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRVP9Q6w-astq6yXnupS0bG7VVRqgVHSCOoZYv9wtEsyw&oe=6AF1FC2F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=h7S6MA_eY2oQ7kNvwGYWuL1&_nc_oc=Adof7k-hyHM81KrgKkvSxpAwQ9owqhQ71Sb_7HK49YzbhoVxSktewyTjntcTXizexMQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRhYzZzFNOzXO2goLryg-9ufBEmF7BHV0z3b7ummGHs2A&oe=6AF1E583"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hffDz9OipEQQ7kNvwHLq2U1&_nc_oc=AdqhjmvtisiLJtwNgBLe8yMWAfqhi9nTh9MGhNh8sc2H_SPBTfUrSHrWWh9XvI3VfPY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSK1Jn8r_JEqkwBU07VSuOYqVCByr2LvwihvoNOCaK0sQ&oe=6AF1DDD8"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EHCIizgM7ygQ7kNvwGPZ6PQ&_nc_oc=AdoA6qpA5hYe6myBWul525jyVYAWRxqc8AGiMci89iipmx1zHPP5kL1AYaoYmkJEXRg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQZk_KIrf-7mh778-1Me5YqQnwqVGGok_4LOOsg_aAJRA&oe=6AF1F0FC"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080